<title>USA: RSR Corp cuts lead price by 4 cents/lb to 48 cents.</title>
<headline>RSR Corp cuts lead price by 4 cents/lb to 48 cents.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>RSR Corp said it cut its price for pure lead by 4.0 cents to 48 cents per pound, effective with shipments from March 11.</p>
<p>The previous price of 52 cents a pound was set on March 20, 1996.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
